---
import Layout from '@/layouts/BlogPost.astro';
const tags = ['Full-Stack Development', 'Web Design', 'UI/UX', 'Cloud Architecture'];
const description = `Developer passionate about creating impactful web experiences`;
---

<Layout
	tags={tags}
	icon="web"
	title="About Me"
	description={description}
	pubDate={new Date('January 01 2024')}
	heroImage="/src/assets/hero.png"
>
	<div class="space-y-6">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Background</h2>
		<p>
			I'm Robi Maulana, a full-stack developer with a passion for creating elegant solutions
			to complex problems. With expertise in modern web technologies and cloud architecture,
			I focus on building scalable and user-friendly applications.
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Skills & Expertise</h2>
		<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
			<li>Frontend Development: React, Vue.js, TypeScript</li>
			<li>Backend Development: Node.js, Python, Java</li>
			<li>Database: PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis</li>
			<li>Cloud Services: AWS, Google Cloud, Azure</li>
			<li>DevOps: Docker, CI/CD, Kubernetes</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Professional Philosophy</h2>
		<p>
			I believe in writing clean, maintainable code and creating intuitive user experiences.
			My approach combines technical excellence with practical business solutions, ensuring
			that every project delivers real value to its users.
		</p>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Current Focus</h2>
		<p>
			Currently, I'm exploring advanced web technologies and contributing to open-source
			projects. I'm particularly interested in performance optimization and building
			accessible web applications.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>